{"id":520,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"These bright Pokémon have acute memories. Apparently delivery workers often choose them as their partners."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It can fly moderately quickly. No matter how far it travels, it can always find its way back to its master and its nest."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"No matter where in the world it goes, it knows where its nest is, so it never gets separated from its Trainer."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White"],"text":"Many people believe that, deep in the forest where Tranquill live, there is a peaceful place where there is no war."},{"games":["Black"],"text":"It can return to its Trainer’s location regardless of the distance separating them."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Big Pecks","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents the Pokémon from having its Defense stat lowered."},{"name":"Super Luck","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is so lucky that the critical-hit ratios of its moves are boosted."},{"name":"Rivalry","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's competitive spirit makes it deal more damage to Pokémon of the same gender, but less damage to Pokémon of the opposite gender."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Gray","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":519,"name":"Pidove","condition":null,"children":[{"id":520,"name":"Tranquill","condition":"Lv. 21","children":[{"id":521,"name":"Unfezant","condition":"Lv. 32","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,16],[1,43],[1,45],[1,98],[12,269],[16,314],[20,207],[26,297],[34,197],[38,403],[44,355],[50,366],[56,143]],"machine":[97,403,213,203,263,19,116,257,182,240,156,496,214,173,211,164,241,129,269,369,253,526],"egg":[],"tutor":[814]},"cards":[{"id":"zsv10pt5-149","name":"Tranquill","set":"Black Bolt","date":"2025-07-18","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"149","artist":"cochi8i","img":"zsv10pt5/149"},{"id"